<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cylink Corp started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cylink Corp started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- UBS Securities analyst Gibbs R. Moody said he initiated coverage of Cylink Corp with a buy.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Cylink's position as a technology leader and its comprehensive product offering will allow it to be a primary beneficiary of the 74 percent growth we estimate for the encryption market between 1997 and the year 2000,&quot; Moody said.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 1/2 at 14-3/4.</p>
</text>
